  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Organization of a workshop to develop the Peace Forest Initiative in Bosnia and Herzegovina</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The workshop aims to provide a platform for information and knowledge sharing among concerned stakeholders, and map out potential areas of collaboration on land-based resource management. Key expected outcome of the workshop includes as following:  br 
(a) Mapping of existing joint activities, initiatives, projects and programmes on land, soil, water, and forest  br 
(b) Identification of thematic priority areas and entry points for cooperation and collaboration on sustainable land management br 
(c) Conceptualization of a preliminary framework and elements of joint programme/project on the restoration of land, soil, water and forest  br 
(d) Exploration on a joint coordination process/mechanism related to land related resource management (land, soil, water and forest)  br 
(e) Understanding of financing opportunities</narrative>
  </description>
